RecipeCapability
├── deterministic gas snapshots
│   ├── measure successful binding and checks, empty execution and read-only checks
│   ├── measure direct implementation, direct account and callback rejection
│   └── measure precondition failure and rollback after postcondition or protocol failure
├── authorization
│   ├── only Merkle-authorized account self-calls execute
│   ├── direct implementation and account calls revert
│   ├── queries, operations, bindings and safety thresholds are pinned in each leaf
│   └── threshold changes require a new accepted root and leaf role
├── interpreter
│   ├── share reads, arithmetic, comparisons and bindings with RecipeExecutor
│   ├── execute direct calls from the account and return numerical result slots
│   ├── capture baseline reads before calls and compare resulting checked deltas
│   ├── reject unsigned deltas in the opposite direction
│   ├── reject Manage and Approve instructions
│   ├── use the account reentrancy guard without taking its lock again
│   └── roll back every write on call, query or assertion failure
└── lending and policy integration
    ├── pin every byte except intended nested lending amounts
    ├── enforce health checks on Aave, Morpho and Euler lending
    ├── borrowing and collateral withdrawal use leaf-pinned minimums
    └── tie 3F policy charges to actual cash and share movements
